#op: develop
A minor version is backward compatible with its predecessor, so an instance of
the predecessor is already an instance of it: translating forward is implicit,
and a minor version's file has no ForwardLens.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	a: string
}
-- ship/tip.thema --
Schema: {
	a:  string
	b?: int
}

ForwardLens: {
	v0_0: _
	tip: {
		b: 1
	}
}
